Source: legeos
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: LegeOS contributors <dev@legeos.org>
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo (>= 1.93), rustc (>= 1.93), pkgconf, libsqlite3-dev, just
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://legeos.org
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/legeos/legeos.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/legeos/legeos

Package: legeos-sessiond
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, xdg-utils
Description: LegeOS session policy daemon
 One user-session daemon hosting application identity and launching (appd), the association
 broker, provider/autostart arbitration, history, notifications, typed settings, projects,
 power and location policy under the bus name org.legeos.Session.

Package: legeos-resourced
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: LegeOS resource governor
 Desktop-aware cgroup v2 + PSI pressure containment as a small, protected process.
 Observe-only until enabled.

Package: legeos-filed
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ffmpeg, systemd, udisks2
Description: LegeOS file service
 Structured browsing and bounded native-codec previews, transactional file operations with
 journal and undo, storage information and reserve, recents, last-used directories and search
 behind the file manager, Home Surface and file-chooser portal.

Package: legeos-hostd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, apt, polkitd
Description: LegeOS host daemon
 Staged kernel/driver update transactions, boot deployments and rollback, driver authority and
 GPU mode, storage reserve and hardware profile on the system bus (org.legeos.Host).

Package: legeos-boot-health
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: LegeOS boot health probe
 System-scope probe gating systemd-bless-boot so a candidate deployment is promoted only when the
 graphics stack and session are healthy.

Package: legeos-session
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, legeos-sessiond, legeos-resourced, legeos-filed, legeos-comp, legeos-shell
Recommends: greetd, legeos-greeter
Description: LegeOS session entry and units
 wayland-sessions entry, legeos-session.target and the core user units with their protection values.

Package: legeos-comp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xwayland
Description: LegeOS compositor
 The display server: one continuous scene across every output, typed overlay layers, a
 compositor-owned recovery band on every window, and the geometry invariants that make a window
 impossible to lose. Window-management policy lives in lege-window; this is what drives it.
 Licensed GPL-3.0-only (ADR-0012); the rest of LegeOS is AGPL-3.0-only (ADR-0013).

Package: legeos-greeter
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, greetd, legeos-comp
Description: LegeOS greeter
 The graphical login surface, on the same toolkit as the shell. It speaks greetd's JSON IPC over
 its socket, so greetd performs the authentication and this package links no PAM, no shadow and
 nothing setuid (ADR-0010 as amended by ADR-0012).

Package: legeos-shell
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, legeos-sessiond, legeos-filed
Description: LegeOS shell
 Restartable shell: Home Field, integrated file browser, panel/dock, launcher and window overview.

Package: legeos-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, legeos-sessiond
Description: LegeOS Settings
 Settings over the typed schema, providers, background applications, associations and history.

Package: lege-files
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, legeos-sessiond, legeos-filed, wl-clipboard
Description: LegeOS standalone file manager
 Pixelkit file manager over the LegeOS browsing, storage, journalled-operation, association and
 launcher services. Closing the window never interrupts an accepted copy or move.

Package: legeos-portal
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xdg-desktop-portal, legeos-sessiond, legeos-filed
Provides: xdg-desktop-portal-backend
Description: LegeOS xdg-desktop-portal backend
 One backend for FileChooser, AppChooser/OpenURI, Background and Settings, all clients of the same services.

Package: legeos-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: LegeOS command line
 lege: one CLI over the OS services, including lege doctor.
